 opponent equal to that monster's original ATK. You can use this effect a number of times per turn up to the number of Normal Monsters used as Fusion Material for this card. Once per turn, when a card or effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can discard 1 card; negate the activation, and if you do, destroy that card, and if you do that, this card gains 1000 ATK."},"38342335":{"role":"Conditional · Link 3","quick":"Phoenix (counting as 2) + a leftover Hu-Li (1) works on an unlocked turn. The shuffle also needs a discard. Three ordinary Level 3 Mikanko can meet the rating, but Sanaki’s usual extension has already locked you. A conditional toolbox slot when spare bodies and a discard are available.","caution":"At least two differently named monsters totaling Link Rating 3. All generic routes require an unlocked turn."},"38811586":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 LIGHT Spellcaster monster\r\nCannot be used as Fusion Material. Your opponent cannot target this card with card effects. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Albion the Sanctifire Dragon\" once per turn. During your opponent's turn (Quick Effect): You can target 2 monsters in any GY(s); Special Summon both monsters, 1 to each field. If this card is in your GY: You can Tribute 4 monsters, the 2 in the Extra Monster Zones and the 2 in the center Main Monster Zones, and if you do, Special Summon this card."},"41373230":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 monster with 2500 or more ATK\r\nGains ATK equal to the combined original Levels of the monsters used for its Fusion Summon x 100. After this card is Fusion Summoned, for the rest of this turn, it is unaffected by the activated effects of any other monsters Special Summoned from the Extra Deck. During the End Phase, if this card is in the GY because it was sent there this turn: You can add to your hand, or Special Summon, 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" or \"Dogmatika\" monster from your Deck. You can only use this effect of \"Titaniklad the Ash Dragon\" once per turn."},"41420027":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Pays half your LP to deny a summon or Spell/Trap activation."},"41927278":{"role":"Equip Spell","quick":"Adds 2000 ATK and assigns battle damage to BOTH players. Against active Uzuhime, your damage share goes to the opponent too: you take 0.","caution":"It is not a Mikanko card. Equip it to the target, not automatically to your attacker. Against a 0 ATK active reflector, a 3300 Kaiju becomes a 10600-damage attack."},"42141493":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Use from an empty field against Deck and Extra Deck summoning strategies."},"42705243":{"role":"Trap","quick":"A set Promise summons a Mikanko from hand/Deck and may equip it from your hand/GY.","caution":"A trap normally cannot activate on the turn it was set. The summoned monster is banished when it leaves the field."},"43527730":{"role":"Equip Spell","quick":"Summons a differently named Mikanko, transfers itself onto it and returns the former equipped monster to hand. Useful for recycling a Kaiju.","caution":"The summon/bounce effect is once per turn. If you bounce the only opposing monster, you may have no monster left to tribute to place the Kaiju again."},"44146295":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster\r\nYou can only control 1 \"Mirrorjade the Iceblade Dragon\". Once per turn (Quick Effect): You can send 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck to the GY that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material; banish 1 monster on the field, also this card cannot use this effect next turn. If this Fusion Summoned card in its owner's control leaves the field because of an opponent's card: You can destroy all monsters your opponent controls during the End Phase of this turn."},"44362883":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material from your Extra Deck, using 2 monsters from your hand, Deck, or field as material. You cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck, except Fusion Monsters, the turn you activate this card. You can only activate 1 \"Branded Fusion\" per turn."},"44649322":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Special Summons a Mikanko from hand ignoring its conditions. The GY effect supplies another Mikanko card to the GY.","caution":"It does not properly Ritual Summon Ohime. Its summoned monster returns to hand during the opponent’s End Phase."},"44886582":{"role":"Two-material Fusion","quick":"Pay 2000 LP and target an Effect Monster; neither player can respond to this activation. Summon an Extra Deck monster with the same Type AND the same Attribute but a different Level, with effects negated. Then fuse using exactly that monster and the target, or send the summoned monster to GY."},"45883110":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"(This card is always treated as a \"Dogmatika\" and \"Despia\" card.)\r\nIf this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 card that mentions it from your Deck to the GY. If a card(s) leaves the Extra Deck (except during the Damage Step): You can target 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\", or 1 monster that mentions it, in your GY, except \"Guiding Quem, the Virtuous\"; Special Summon it. You can only use each effect of \"Guiding Quem, the Virtuous\" once per turn."},"46986414":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"''The ultimate wizard in terms of attack and defense.''"},"47705572":{"role":"GY Fusion","quick":"Pendulum effect Fusion Summons a Lunalight using materials banished from field or GY; its scale restricts Pendulum Summons to Lunalights."},"48130397":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Discard 1 card; Fusion Summon 1 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from either field as Fusion Material. Neither player can activate cards or effects in response to this card's activation."},"48444114":{"role":"Revival · search","quick":"Revive a Lunalight from GY. Its GY effect banishes Perfume and discards a card as activation costs, then searches a Lunalight monster. A monster discarded for this cost does not trigger an effect requiring a send by card effect."},"48770333":{"role":"Monster","quick":"Third Kaiju; another 3300 ATK damage target.","caution":"Check the current card text and turn restrictions before committing."},"50005218":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Targets another card, excavates 3, and can find a Striker card. Its target need not remain for the excavation."},"50546208":{"role":"Bounce · search","quick":"Target another Lunalight card you control, return it to hand to Special Summon Marten from hand/GY in Defense Position; banish Marten when it leaves the field. If sent to GY by card effect, search a Lunalight Spell/Trap."},"51227866":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, targets an opposing GY monster to banish it—or at 3 Spells, Special Summon it instead. The borrowed monster cannot attack and occupies your runway."},"51409648":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 Beast, Beast-Warrior, or Winged Beast monster\r\nWhen a Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster's effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can negate that effect, then you can return 1 monster from the field to the hand. During your opponent's turn, while this card is in your GY (Quick Effect): You can target 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" in your GY; Special Summon either that monster or this card, and banish the other. You can only use each effect of \"Rindbrumm the Striking Dragon\" once per turn."},"51777272":{"role":"2 Lunalights; a Super Duper stepping stone toward Panther Dancer.","quick":"12318"},"52340444":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, creates a DARK Ace Token in Defense Position that cannot be Tributed. If 3 Spells are in the GY when Hornet resolves, the Token becomes 1500/1500. The card has no printed once-per-turn clause."},"53174748":{"role":"Trap","quick":"Equip a targeted face-up opposing monster to your Mikanko as an Equip Spell.","caution":"It is targeting interaction; check the opponent’s protection. Do not count its equipped monster as a monster-zone Link or Xyz material."},"54701958":{"role":"Leo Dancer + 3 Lunalights; must be Fusion Summoned with those materials. Unaffected except by Lunalight cards; sends a Lunalight from Extra Deck to GY as cost for its board wipe.","quick":"21441"},"54862960":{"role":"Monster","quick":"An equipped Ni-Ni can take a face-up opposing monster during their turn until the End Phase.","caution":"She must be equipped and it must be the opponent’s turn. Targeting protection can prevent the steal."},"55273560":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If your opponent controls more monsters than you do, you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You can only Special Summon \"Incredible Ecclesia, the Virtuous\" once per turn this way. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Incredible Ecclesia, the Virtuous\" once per turn. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can Tribute this card; Special Summon 1 \"Swordsoul\" monster or 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" from your hand or Deck. During the End Phase, if a Fusion Monster(s) was sent to your GY this turn: Add this card from the GY to your hand."},"57103969":{"role":"Starter access","quick":"On activation, search a Level 4 or lower Beast-Warrior, usually Gold Leo. Scarlet Tiger is Level 5 and cannot be searched this way."},"57566760":{"role":"LIGHT · Rank 3 · ATK 0","quick":"Your main Xyz attacker. Needs two Level 3 Mikanko. Finds Sword, survives battle and makes the opponent take battle damage you would have taken. No Equip Card is needed for her reflection.","caution":"Two Level 3 Mikanko are required. After a completed attack, including a direct attack, detach 1 at the end of the Damage Step to attack again in a row. Two materials can supply up to three attacks; the Equip search alone is once per turn."},"57736667":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Protects its equipped monster from effect de