":"Interaction","quick":"Negate a face-up opposing monster. Activate from hand only when you control no cards; when Set, also watch its Spell/Trap column."},"11161666":{"role":"EARTH · Level 3 · ATK 0","quick":"The bridge to two Level 3 bodies: becoming equipped lets her summon a non-Illusion Mikanko from Deck.","caution":"She has no battle-damage reflection. After Twins sends her, decline her optional GY-equip effect if you need Fire Dance to revive her. Her Deck-summon effect imposes the Mikanko Extra Deck restriction."},"11317977":{"role":"Poly access","quick":"Discard itself as cost to add Polymerization from Deck or a Lunalight monster other than Black Sheep from GY. If sent to GY as Fusion material: recover a face-up Lunalight Pendulum Monster from your Extra Deck, or a Lunalight monster other than Black Sheep from your GY."},"11321089":{"role":"3 differently named monsters, at least one from hand and one from field. Requires its stated Fusion Summon and cannot be made with GY-only materials.","quick":"16845"},"11765832":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"2 monsters with the same Type and Attribute, but different names\r\nAny battle damage your opponent takes from battles involving this card is doubled. If this card is sent to the GY: You can draw 1 card. You can only use this effect of \"Garura, Wings of Resonant Life\" once per turn."},"11876803":{"role":"Extender","quick":"Can Special Summon itself from hand after you activate a Lunalight monster effect. If sent to GY by card effect, revives an eligible Lunalight but that monster cannot activate its effects."},"12421694":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Stops an opposing monster from attacking and buys another turn of resources."},"12580477":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Simple full opposing monster clear."},"13935001":{"role":"GY extender","quick":"In your Main Phase, banish it from GY as cost; on resolution, send a card from hand to GY, then summon a Lunalight from Deck if you sent a card. Its face-up trap