IRE · Level 3 · ATK 0","quick":"An equipped Ha-Re searches a Mikanko Equip Spell. A good Arabesque / Fire Dance extender.","caution":"A monster that is merely summoned without becoming equipped does not trigger her search. Double-Edged Sword is not a Mikanko Equip Spell, so Ha-Re cannot search it."},"19096726":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"When your opponent activates a monster effect, while you control a Fusion Monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material (Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand or face-up field to the GY; negate that effect. If this card is banished: You can add from your Deck to your hand, 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\", or 1 monster that mentions it, except \"Tri-Brigade Mercourier\". You can only use each effect of \"Tri-Brigade Mercourier\" once per turn."},"19304410":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If you control a \"Tri-Brigade\" or \"Springans\" monster, except \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\": You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is sent to the GY: You can Special Summon 1 of the following monsters from your GY in Defense Position, except \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\".\r\n● \"Tri-Brigade\" monster ● \"Springans\" monster\r\n● \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 monster that mentions it\r\nYou can only use each effect of \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\" once per turn."},"24010609":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Targets another controlled card at activation, sends it during resolution, then shields later Spell activations from responses. In the End Phase it Sets different Striker Spell names based on activations while face-up."},"24094653":{"role":"Fusion","quick":"Fuse with monsters in hand/field. It is recyclable through Masquerade and Kaleido Chick."},"24224830":{"role":"Protection","quick":"Target one monster in the opponent’s GY, banish it and negate the corresponding effects through the end of the next turn. Limited to one."},"24299458":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Sends cards as cost. Chained Quick-Plays can become efficient payment."},"24550676":{"role":"Panther Dancer + 2 Lunalights; protects itself from opposing targeting and opposing destruction, attacks twice.","quick":"12320"},"24915933":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Blazing Cartesia, the Virtuous\" + 1 LIGHT or DARK monster\r\nIf this card is Fusion Summoned: You can send 1 Level 6 or higher LIGHT or DARK monster from your Deck or Extra Deck to the GY. If a monster is Special Summoned by your opponent's activated monster effect (except during the Damage Step): You can banish this card from your field or GY; Special Summon 1 \"Dogmatika\" monster from your Deck or 1 \"Despia\" monster from your Extra Deck. You can only use each effect of \"Granguignol the Dusk Dragon\" once per turn."},"25072579":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Rewrites an opponent's 2000+ ATK monster effect into destroying one of your Ace Links."},"25311006":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Becomes live after an opponent's monster effect in your Main Phase."},"25451383":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"This card's name becomes \"Fallen of Albaz\" while on the field or in the GY. If this card is in your hand or GY: You can send 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap from your hand or Deck to the GY; apply the following effect based on where you sent it from.\r\n● Hand: Special Summon this card.\r\n● Deck: Place this card on the bottom of the Deck, then, if you placed this card from your hand, draw 1 card.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Albion the Shrouded Dragon\" once per turn."},"26077387":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Quick Effect Tributes herself to deploy a Sky Striker Ace to the Extra Monster Zone."},"29301450":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Generic interaction, but unavailable after Linkage resolves because it is not a Sky Striker Ace."},"29948294":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Reveal 1 monster in your hand and send 1 Level 8 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck to the GY with the same Type that has 2500 ATK 