e committing."},"50005218":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Targets another card, excavates 3, and can find a Striker card. Its target need not remain for the excavation."},"50546208":{"role":"Bounce · search","quick":"Target another Lunalight card you control, return it to hand to Special Summon Marten from hand/GY in Defense Position; banish Marten when it leaves the field. If sent to GY by card effect, search a Lunalight Spell/Trap."},"51227866":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, targets an opposing GY monster to banish it—or at 3 Spells, Special Summon it instead. The borrowed monster cannot attack and occupies your runway."},"51409648":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Fallen of Albaz\" + 1 Beast, Beast-Warrior, or Winged Beast monster\r\nWhen a Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Monster's effect is activated (Quick Effect): You can negate that effect, then you can return 1 monster from the field to the hand. During your opponent's turn, while this card is in your GY (Quick Effect): You can target 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" in your GY; Special Summon either that monster or this card, and banish the other. You can only use each effect of \"Rindbrumm the Striking Dragon\" once per turn."},"51777272":{"role":"2 Lunalights; a Super Duper stepping stone toward Panther Dancer.","quick":"12318"},"52340444":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, creates a DARK Ace Token in Defense Position that cannot be Tributed. If 3 Spells are in the GY when Hornet resolves, the Token becomes 1500/1500. The card has no printed once-per-turn clause."},"53174748":{"role":"Trap","quick":"Equip a targeted face-up opposing monster to your Mikanko as an Equip Spell.","caution":"It is targeting interaction; check the opponent’s protection. Do not count its equipped monster as a monster-zone Link or Xyz material."},"54701958":{"role":"Leo Dancer + 3 Lunalights; must be Fusion Summoned with those materials. Unaffected except by Lunalight cards; se