amed Dark Time Wizard Spells/Traps, then discard 1.","caution":"Level 5 (not Level 4): it makes Rank 5 with the K9 monsters. It can attack directly."},"76660178":{"role":"WATER · Level 4 Warrior · ATK 1850","quick":"When they activate a monster effect on the field or attack, with another face-up Dark Time Wizard card (or Umi) on either field (a Set card does not count): Special Summon it from the hand and destroy one of their monsters.","caution":"It returns to the hand in the End Phase. It does not stop targeting."},"3129527":{"role":"Quick-Play Spell · Dark Time Wizard engine","quick":"Up to 4 Scapegoat Tokens, then Swiftwind Panther Warrior from the Deck if they control a monster. The Tokens can be destroyed instead of your Dark Time Wizard cards.","caution":"For the rest of the turn you can only Special Summon Fusion Monsters from the Extra Deck: use it last or on their turn."},"76630812":{"role":"Quick-Play Spell · Dark Time Wizard engine","quick":"Two dice: your Dark Time Wizard monsters gain, and theirs lose, ATK/DEF = total x 200. From the GY: when they summon, banish it and roll two dice; 6 or more destroys that monster.","caution":"Best discarded to Alligator's Dragon Knight so the GY effect is ready."},"65118318":{"role":"Normal Trap · Dark Time Wizard engine","quick":"Send a Dark Time Wizard card from the Deck to the GY, then Special Summon a monster from either GY to your field.","caution":"From the GY: banish it to Set a Dark Time Wizard Spell/Trap from your GY, or any Spell/Trap from theirs."},"2606417":{"role":"Continuous Trap · Dark Time Wizard engine","quick":"Gains dice counters each Standby Phase. When their monster effect activates on the field or they attack: remove a counter and toss a coin; if right, a Dark Time Wizard monster comes from the Deck and their monster becomes 0 ATK with effects negated.","caution":"Not once per turn: it works while it has counters."},"17242022":{"role":"DARK · Level 9 Fusion · ATK 3400","quick":"Special Summon it